# Case officer journeys

Journey boards for case officer review work. Frames reuse [TEC PCN blockframes](/tec-pcn-blockframes.html) and [ExUI form elements](/exui-form-elements.html). Yellow outline (`highlight`) and link-blue (`callout`) mark the control that starts each step. Hover blocks for element names.

## Journey: Review OOT decision

The case officer opens a case from **My work**, reviews it on **Case details**, and chooses **Agree with OOT refusal** or **Overturn OOT refusal** from Next step. The next screen asks them to confirm. Submitting returns them to Case details with a success banner under the Manage Cases bar.

