<div class="bf-journey__step"><%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_my_tasks_minimal", locals: { caption: "1. My work — My tasks", compact: true, highlight_case: true } %><p class="bf-journey__note">The journey starts on My work. The case officer selects the task and clicks the <strong>case number</strong>.</p></div>
<div class="bf-journey__arrow"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="bf-journey__arrow-label">Case link</span></div>
<div class="bf-journey__step"><%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_pcn_case_details", locals: { caption: "2. TEC PCN — Case details", highlight_next_step: true } %><p class="bf-journey__note">They open the case on the <strong>Case details</strong> tab and choose <strong>Agree with OOT refusal</strong> or <strong>Overturn OOT refusal</strong> from Next step.</p></div>
<div class="bf-journey__arrow"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="bf-journey__arrow-label">Next step</span></div>
<div class="bf-journey__step"><%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_co_oot_review", locals: { caption: "3. Agree with OOT refusal", decision: :agree } %><p class="bf-journey__note">The screen is titled <strong>Agree with OOT refusal</strong>. The Yes/No question asks whether they are sure they want to Agree with the out of time refusal.</p></div>
<div class="bf-journey__arrow"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="bf-journey__arrow-label">or</span></div>
<div class="bf-journey__step"><%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_co_oot_review", locals: { caption: "4. Overturn OOT refusal", decision: :overturn } %><p class="bf-journey__note">The screen is titled <strong>Overturn OOT refusal</strong>. The Yes/No question asks whether they are sure they want to overturn the out of time refusal.</p></div>
<div class="bf-journey__arrow"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="bf-journey__arrow-label">Submit</span></div>
<div class="bf-journey__step"><%= partial "partials/blockframe/views/tec_pcn_case_details", locals: { caption: "5. TEC PCN — Case details", success_banner: "You have agreed with the out of time refusal" } %><p class="bf-journey__note">Submitting returns them to <strong>Case details</strong>. A success banner under the Manage Cases bar confirms the decision: agreed with the out of time refusal, or the refusal was overturned.</p></div>
